{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rJIie407i4V3I-aW5iIeWQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.422705+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rJIie407i4V3I-aW5iIeWQ","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2QPF1GpYRDuOczl50Dl3PfDzrknftgxMMln8xDal7E2lp8WrotxMgvTib5MxC46sz7xDsFjRfN6HjEdsFSogbSiaFZQlibrPrV0U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2abQpoQqj8tCkJTrPib0Anic6xVWyl1uiaAHr5mfPPQ27F9XPwibwCpa7h3Jq3N9QenbGZibUAUqjLKLNLQN1tmpCdV0rV7UllKV9o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>南京理工大学自动化学院</span></strong></span><span>是在原中国人民解放军军事工程学院（哈军工）炮兵工程系指挥仪专业和火炮系随动系统专业基础上，经过了不断改造和调整，于1985年正式成立了华东工学院自动控制系，1997年改名为南京理工大学自动化系，2005年更名为南京理工大学自动化学院。</span></p><p><span>学院拥有“控制科学与工程”、“电气工程”</span><em><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong></em><span>个一级学科。拥有国家级虚拟仿真实验教学中心、“自主智能无人系统信息感知与协同控制”部级国际科技合作基地、“交通信息融合与系统控制”工业和信息化部重点实验室、江苏省实验教学示范中心、工业与信息化部实验教学示范中心以及“多运动体信息感知与协同控制”江苏省重点实验室、“复杂运动体智能导航与控制”江苏省工程研究中心等高端教学科研公共平台。</span></p><p><span>学院现有教职工</span><strong><em><span><span>179</span></span></em></strong><span>人，其中两院院士</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国家级教学名师</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国家级领军人才</span><strong><em><span><span>8</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国家级青年人才</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>人、“全国创新争先奖”获得者</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、“国家百千万人才工程”获评者</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人。拥有全国高校黄大年式教师团队</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>个，教育部创新团队</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>个、江苏省青蓝工程科技创新团队</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>个、江苏省“六大人才高峰”创新人才团队</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>个，</span><strong><em><span><span></span></span></em></strong><span>教育部虚拟教研室建设试点</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>个，江苏省创新团队</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>个。学院在校本科生</span><strong><em><span><span>1602</span></span></em></strong><span>人，硕士研究生</span><strong><em><span><span>1292</span></span></em></strong><span>人，博士研究生</span><strong><em><span><span>274</span></span></em></strong><span>人。研究生年度就业率</span><strong><em><span><span>100%</span></span></em></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>“十三五”以来，获国家科技进步一等奖、国家技术发明二等奖、国家自然科学二等奖等省部级及以上科技荣誉和奖励近</span><strong><em><span><span>40</span></span></em></strong><span>余项。近年来，学院承担了国家自然科学基金重大研究计划重点支持、国家重点研发计划政府间国际科技创新合作、部委重大重点项目等一大批国家级科研项目。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1iagzQ2O2oEEp5nT3HPpIXZsSSicPwn6p1sLrUIkDFX3Z7h1V8pfJUX3D9Is6zlG0libRqC2QuiaxPNU3RichGLcePRr3pBIAfLjWw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3HhwudexJPJiaD3iac5csrXW3Cb08RZj86sakM7K2VY7ym1BAFfm3iaL1XE3Utic79vdRNrUO41u7Xu3Cgic8uicQcylokiahFmHwHLY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>人数400人左右</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>现在-2026年7月31日截止</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为自动化、电气及相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>登录研究生院招生网站https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/，点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过学院网站进行通知。</span></span></p><p><span>报名截止日期为：2026年7月31日。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人将申请表、个人陈述、本科阶段成绩、英语水平证明及其他证明材料等，扫描为一个pdf，发至</span><span><strong><span>联系邮箱yz110@njust.edu.cn</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>活动内容：学院情况介绍、研究生教育及就业情况介绍、学科团队研究方向介绍等；</span></p><p><span>具体安排：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0swk1xWCtd2Px140FOkC9ofWHicJWjicyYXgl5RDt6sqGK88948UiauZDRJVcvVOEMA4hLynhWXyzUoIykZyYJIpjpicT3j3SORuI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>彭老师</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系电话</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>025-84318726</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮箱</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>yz110@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名人员加群（QQ）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>780203775</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2GcvHetaegJFBfLMjIsFLSyYziaeMVpNqJicynSpmjwuXHoIxT4nR8LaaP8UBkQzsLdhovGAFEzWyv2PyB99oLtunnbXSk64TM4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 自动化学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 自动化学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 于雷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2J6BxvmmwrklOR1wPXLDtbXPTDfwiaxbM9Qd9wTwslXhmyQbCST6ibYYp3rhZEYicOQmzPdicB3gJT7dnIkYia0YjiaP12wm6n9BXl0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8d0a782b475b3028f113aa2afa8e9db800320c1fa06007925b600f01f6c0a81f","textLength":1249,"sourceSha256":"d1b0a0d2be6caeee2d90fad8fd51840510c1bd28b35d5d64ee48cc3b5bdb418c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d12cafc762eb247e6d3d","title":"2026年南京理工大学自动化学院2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.422705+00:00"}
